### 五、完整调用拓扑图

```
触发层
  union_resource (ApplyAreaWithCache) ─┐
  paas_limit (GetDemoUidV2)           ─┤
                                       │
         DoUnionDispatchRemove ← POST /v1/uadispatch/remove (Mode=1)
                                       │
调度编排层                              ▼
  union-archiver-dispatch (uad)
    Remove handler → Worker.Dispatch() → go startSyncDispatch()
      → dispatchTask() → RequestDispatchArchiver (mode=1)
                         │
                         ▼ POST /v1/uarchiver/dispatch
  union-archiver-manager (uam)
    Dispatch handler → RequestAreaDispatchArchive (mode=1)
      → 写调度状态 SYNCDISPATCHPREPARE
                         │
                         ▼ POST /v1/group/dispatch (SyncDispatchArchiver 300000117)
  archiver-manager (am)
    GroupDistaptch → CreateDispatchTask (data-channel)
      → NotifyVmDispatchRet (vm-manager)

执行层
  data-channel → 实际存档搬运（导出→传输→导入）

回传层
  data-channel → Kafka dispatch_result_notify
    ├─→ UAM dispatchRetHandler → SYNCDISPATCHDONE / GAMEPREPARE
    └─→ uad dispatchRetHandler → DispatchRet() → Clean()（清理旧存档）

调度状态机
  union-storage-scheduler
    Assign (AMSyncMove) → 跳过写入
    Commit → SYNCDISPATCH* → GAMEPREPARE
```

---

### 六、关键差异：实时迁移 vs 异步迁移

| 维度 | 实时迁移（SyncDispatch, mode=1） | 异步迁移（AsynDispatch, mode=0） |
|------|------|------|
| 触发方 | `union_resource` ApplyArea 时触发 | `doRemoveTask` 定时器批量触发 |
| 入口 | `DoUnionDispatchRemove` → POST `/v1/uadispatch/remove` mode=1 | `RequestRemoveArchiver` → POST `/v1/uadispatch/remove` mode=0 |
| 执行方式 | `go startSyncDispatch()` 异步 goroutine，重试10次 | `startAsynDispatch()` 同步执行，有并发控制 |
| 调度状态 | SYNCDISPATCHPREPARE → SYNCDISPATCHDONE → GAMEPREPARE | DISPATCHPREPARE → DISPATCHDONE |
| 失败重试 | `DispatchRet` 中重试 + `CheckSyncTask` 超时检测 | `doRetryDispatchTask` 逻辑 |
| UAM 锁键 | `uss/{uuid}-{ugid}-{mode}` | `uss/{uuid}-{ugid}` |
| 调度接口 | `IMCUArvhicerDispatch_SyncDispatchArchiver` (300000117) | `IMCArchiverManager_DispatchArchive` |

---

**总结：** 实时存档迁移的触发方是 `union_resource`（用户启动游戏申请区域时检测到存档跨区域）和 `paas_limit`（演示账号），核心编排由 `union-archiver-dispatch`（uad）→ `union-archiver-manager`（uam）→ `archiver-manager`（am）→ `data-channel` 四级串联完成，结果通过 Kafka `dispatch_result_notify` 回传，状态机由 `union-storage-scheduler`（uss）最终收敛到 `GAMEPREPARE`。

